    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE MINIMUM WAGES (INDIAN LABOUR)ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 135)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      262.97,
      401.91,
      286.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      298.97,
      401.88,
      322.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Minimum Wages(Indian Labour) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2020.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      334.97,
      401.91,
      382.31
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 4 of the Minimum Wages (Indian Labour)Ordinance (Chapter 135) (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby amended by the substitutionfor the words \u201cfourteen years,\u201d of the words \u201csixteen years,\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      394.97,
      401.82,
      418.31
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 11 of the principal enactment is herebyamended as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      430.97,
      401.89,
      466.31
    ],
    "text": "(1)by the substitution in paragraph (b) of subsection(1) thereof, for the words \u201cfourteen years\u201d of thewords \u201csixteen years\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      478.97,
      401.88,
      502.31
    ],
    "text": "(2)by the substitution in subsection (2) thereof, for thewords \u201cfourteen years\u201d of the words \u201csixteen years\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      514.97,
      401.9,
      562.31
    ],
    "text": "4.Section 18 of the principal enactment is herebyamended in the definition of the expression \u201cminimum ratesof wages\u201d by the substitution for the words \u201cfifteen years\u201d ofthe words \u201csixteen years\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      574.97,
      401.9,
      598.31
    ],
    "text": "5.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
